Everything in this directory is SYNTHETIC test data, hand-written to have the same SHAPE
as a real instance's broker feeds and state, so the engine and the behaviour diff can be
tested against something realistic.

  - tickers are AAA/BBB/CCC/DDD/EEE… — not securities anyone holds
  - the account number is 000000000
  - order ids are 00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000N
  - every price, weight and date is invented

This file tells `tools/secret_scan.py` to skip its SHAPE rules here (a fixture is supposed to
look like state.json). It does NOT waive the account-number rule — that one has no
acceptable exception anywhere in this repo, including in fixtures.

⛔ Never copy a real instance's state.json, JOURNAL.md or failures.jsonl into this
directory. If you need realistic data, hand-edit this fixture instead.
